ht now – and is unlikely to do so in the future</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122301532.cms" /&gt;A few months ago, right after Trump reclaimed the White House, he couldn’t stop gushing about his friend Elon. When SpaceX’s Starship booster landed back on its chopstick arms after a test flight, Trump said at a campaign rally: “Did you see the way that sucker landed today? That’s the greatest thing I’ve ever seen. Elon is an absolute genius – nobody else could ever do that.”</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/politics-rocket-science-ameriac-party-elon-musk-donald-trump/articleshow/122301532.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/politics-rocket-science-ameriac-party-elon-musk-donald-trump/articleshow/122301532.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-07T20:12:36+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122301679,imgsize-86718.cms"/></item><item><title>'Reductive perspective': Indian-origin woman who slammed Zohran Mamdani's glorification now calls Mira Nair 'Hinduphobic'</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122301539.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/reductive-perspective-indian-origin-woman-who-slammed-zohran-mamdanis-glorification-now-calls-mira-nair-hinduphobic/articleshow/122301539.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/reductive-perspective-indian-origin-woman-who-slammed-zohran-mamdanis-glorification-now-calls-mira-nair-hinduphobic/articleshow/122301539.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-07T20:03:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="i