rder="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122293731.cms" /&gt;An Indian vlogger, Nitish Advitiy, ignited social media with a video branding New York City as "America's Stinkiest City." The clip captures smoke billowing from manholes, a sight that seemed normal to locals but shocked international viewers. This sparked debate about Western media's focus on hygiene issues in developing countries while overlooking similar problems in their own cities.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/americas-stinkiest-city-smoke-filled-nyc-streets-leave-indian-vlogger-stunned-video/articleshow/122293731.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/americas-stinkiest-city-smoke-filled-nyc-streets-leave-indian-vlogger-stunned-video/articleshow/122293731.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-07T13:43:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122293818,imgsize-878630.cms"/></item><item><title>Wildfire erupts near Kelowna airport: Tactical evacuations ordered, flights suspended amid firefighting efforts - video</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122288675.cms" /&gt;A fast-moving wildfire near Kelowna International Airport in British Columbia triggered tactical evacuations and grounded numerous flights. The blaze, named Whelan Creek, rapidly spread, prompting a multi-agency response including air tankers and ground crews. While the fire is now being held, tactical evacuations were conducted, and the airport temporarily suspended operations, impacting over 25 flights.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/wildfire-erupts-near-kelowna-airport-tactical-evacuations-ordered-flights-suspended-amid-firefighting-efforts-video/articleshow/122288675.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/wildfire-erupts-near-kelowna-airport-tactical-evacuations-ordered-flights-suspended-amid-firefighting-efforts-video/articleshow/122288675.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-07T10:09:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122290959,imgsize-3972174.cms"/></item><item><title>Head-on collision on Nigeria highway: 21 killed in accident; truck hits passenger vehicle on wrong lane</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122295912.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/head-on-collision-on-nigeria-highway-21-killed-in-accident-truck-hits-passenger-vehicle-on-wrong-lane/articleshow/122295912.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/head-on-collision-on-nigeria-highway-21-killed-in-accident-truck-hits-passenger-vehicle-on-wrong-lane/articleshow/122295912.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-07T15:24:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-122295999,imgsize-820146.cms"/></item><item><title>Ukraine: Discrimination and hope drive LGBTQ+ soldiers</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/122295257.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/ukraine-discrimination-and-hope-drive-lgbtq-soldiers/articleshow/122295257.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/ukraine-discrimination-and-hope-drive-lgbtq-soldiers/articleshow/122295257.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-07-07T15:16:08+05:30</